        "summary": "Token quota status",
        "description": "Returns resolved monthly max tokens (0 = unlimited) and usage for the current UTC month. Same rules as enforcement: preferences override, then STRIPE_B2C_PRICE_TOKEN_CAPS_JSON free tier.",
